LSM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.2","title":"Are you involved in a murder?!","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-10-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After Hiroto gets a message on Lion's phone directing him to a specific place, he tells Michito to look after Lion and sets out to find the location.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m84n3U3mRyTE74Z8xyEF6k9Q6FJ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.3","title":"We GO to the Zoo! Also, Who are his parents?","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hiroto believes he may have found out who Lion's father is. Later, he takes Michito and Lion to go see Michito’s art on display at the zoo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tnL8s1p8xwvPycMvv1jYGNf8EKI.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.4","title":"Birthdays are happy days","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After Lion suddenly comes down with a fever, a worried Hiroto takes him to the hospital but realizes he doesn't even know how old the boy is.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/prxrvrRUCJIInI7uiQTCrcjPLvt.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.5","title":"I'm Going to See My Mother~","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-11-08T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kudo writes an article claiming that Aoi is still alive. A mysterious man tells Aoi her cover has been blown and helps her evade the police.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hCUBOn6eKMSzz5ZQ7yvvb9fO4M2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.6","title":"The decision of My Sister and the truth","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hiroto reads a news article about Aoi and wonders why she would tell such a blatant lie. Later, he learns the stunning truth about her and Lion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9NJW4fzVVlYJnoTZnS9C1PWFOCc.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.7","title":"The trip to protect Lion","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In hopes of keeping Lion’s whereabouts a secret, Hiroto takes him to an island with Michito. Meanwhile, Shougo visits the Komori brothers’ house.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1871iUJNLzgmCCFUrDJza9vn9wq.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.8","title":"The Sister's commitment...and a time to say goodbye","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With Yurugi's help, Aoi heads to Sado to reunite with her family. Later, she explains her actions, and Hiroto expresses his pent-up frustrations.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mXXG4dYDCxCRNQcXmhzLwauWw6U.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.9","title":"I want to save Lion!","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2024-12-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hiroto and Michito hurry to the Tachibana house to rescue Aoi and Lion but find no one there. Meanwhile, Aoi and Shougo come to an agreement.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wU1cUAZOYC76yJDF1wgi3iThTIV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.10","title":"The biggest storm and Falling out of love","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2024-12-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Inspired by Michito's decision to participate in an overnight trial at a new artists' group home, Hiroto takes action to rescue Aoi and Lion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/apqXcyi8qFjwHZCQbTXhdPt7d82.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvTGlnaHQtb2YtTXktTGlvbi0yMDI0Lw.1.11","title":"Our New Beginning","season":1,"episode":11,"released":"2024-12-20T00:00:00.000Z","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6CFSaLtIVuWcTchIYZMgAUgJLgE.jpg"}]}}